      }
    },
    "1. %@ 將減少 %@ %@ (資產)" : {
      "comment" : "A label describing a financial transaction where one account's asset value is decreased by a certain amount, and another account's liability value is increased by the same amount. The first argument is the name of the account that will have its asset value decreased. The second argument is the formatted amount of currency that will be deducted from that account.",
